-- File: sdnfudaupgrade.pmldat

   Either place SDNF Upgrade macros in the directory structure pointed
   to by the PMLLIB environment variable, or change temporarily the
   PMLLIB environment variable to include the directory where the
   macros are located in the PML search path.


INSTRUCTIONS FOR CREATING UDAs FOR USE IN THE AVEVA SDNF INTERFACE
====================================================================

Ensure you have write access to your structural dictionary databases.
In a command window in Lexicon run the upgrade by the following command.

      call !!sdnfUDAUpgrade( )

The macro suite will check to see if this upgrade has already been executed.
Save your changes by exiting from Lexicon normally, not by QUIT.
